        "correction": "By default, pthread mutexes are process-private. Attempting to lock a process-private mutex in shared memory from a different process induces undefined behavior. Mutex attributes must explicitly enable `pthread_mutexattr_setpshared(&attr, PTHREAD_PROCESS_SHARED)`."
